! ============================================================
! 01a  Your first calculation: one energy
! ============================================================
! Water at a fixed, sensible geometry.  HF/STO-3G is the
! smallest calculation that is still a real one: it runs in
! well under a second.
!
! WHAT TO LOOK AT in the output, in order:
!   Section 1  the basis: 7 functions, 5 occupied orbitals
!   Section 3  the SCF table -- watch dE fall by ~an order of
!              magnitude per iteration once DIIS engages
!   Section 7  Total energy, about -74.96 Eh
!
! The total energy of a molecule is a large negative number
! and is NOT itself meaningful: only DIFFERENCES between
! energies computed the same way mean anything.  Every other
! example in this set is ultimately a difference.
%method  HF
%basis   sto-3g
%job     energy
%charge  0
%mult    1

%geo
 O   0.0000000   0.0000000   0.1173000
 H   0.0000000   0.7572000  -0.4692000
 H   0.0000000  -0.7572000  -0.4692000
